	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040f"},
		line=732,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Sure enough, the headquarters is in a state of chaos.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"As though too frustrated to even sit still, most of the warriors remain standing, fiercely arguing with each other all the while.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Order! I shall have order!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori bellows a loud rebuke at the room.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Instantly, the chatter comes to a halt.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There was no meeting called. What is the meaning of assembling of your own accord?!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If the location of our headquarters is discovered, we will see a repeat of the August Incident!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Naturally, all the warriors' eyes gather in Maki's direction.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"It seems like a confrontation between the two of them is inevitable.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We made sure we weren't tailed. Nothin' to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Kazuma casually strokes his chin as he replies.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"His face betrays not even the barest hint of tension.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For what reason did you come here?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't it obvious, acting chairman?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I came to make sure my boys don't do anything... without me knowin' about it.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We can't have people goin' round breakin' the rules now, can we?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"He gives Hotori his best smile, a characteristic prelude before blowing his fuse.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"The acting chairman and the vice chairman─",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The two silently glare at each other, neither one backing down.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The gathered warriors all hold their breath at the impending confrontation between House Inou, head of the warriors, and House Maki, the second most influential.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have yet to confirm the news of Her Majesty's marriage.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is possible that it's merely bait intended to lure us out.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So what if it's bait? We'll swallow the whole damn hook along with it.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We must wait until the time is right before baring our fangs.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That time is now, dammit!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ahem, when else is there gonna be a better time besides now?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Even those spineless cowards who abandoned their blades won't sit back and let the Imperial Family be sullied by filthy foreign blood.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"That's precisely the problem.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The August Incident delivered a devastating blow to the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"After witnessing such a massive setback, more than a few of our members decided to abandon the cause.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"We call these warriors the “moderates,” represented by the Sarashina faction and headed by Miyoshi's own Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"The moderates may have left the Sworn Blades, but not all of them have cast aside the blade for good.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"If their hearts are stirred to action, they will surely cooperate with the Sworn Blades again.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"This belief is why our rebellion desperately needs Empress\nHisui's Imperial standard on our side.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we rise up now, we will just be moths flocking to a flame.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On our way here, we saw a bunch of military vehicles being mobilized.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if we can eventually get the moderates to cooperate, now is not the time.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we stage an ill-prepared uprising now and get crushed, there will be no next time.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I see playin' with flowers all day has made you go soft.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Or maybe that chick you've been fuckin' around with has defanged you?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Maki shifts his target towards me.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"That's for the best. Hotori and Maki coming into conflict would be bad for the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Word sure travels fast. I didn't know you had that much of an interest in me.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Course I'm interested in you. Ain't we s'posed to be good friends?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Kazuma shows me a smile that doesn't quite reach his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"It's a smile that belies a barely concealed lust for steel.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's been a while since I've seen the Koubukan's bladesmanship in action.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I'm down to have a go whenever.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Personal fights are forbidden.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Hotori offers a quiet but firm admonition from the\nchairman's seat.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, I can sympathize with how your feelings burn with fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But it is just as Tokita says. The Republic is perfectly prepared for us to take action.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you think about it calmly, now is the absolute worst time to rise up.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we join up with the moderates and get defeated, there will be no coming back!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“None of that matters, goddammit!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Maki falls silent.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As acting chairman, the one thing I will not abide is sending my comrades into a hopeless battle!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, there are many young men here who respect you. Surely you do not wish to send them to die in vain?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As house head of one of the Three Founders, as their revered elder, you must set an example for your disciples.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Believe me. When the time comes, I'll be counting on you to you lead the charge and wreak as much havoc as you want.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Treatin' me like an old fogey now?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I merely said that you ought to act as a role model for the youths that follow you.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"After casting his gaze across the room, Maki slumps his shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our next spellblade retrieval operation is this weekend. I ask you now, more than ever, to please follow the rules.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If anything untoward were to occur before then, we'll have to postpone the entire operation.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah. You got it, madam acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We also wouldn't want anythin' to rain on our parade this weekend.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Hotori nods.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“All right, boys! Let's get back to our drinks!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Maki struts out with a gang of young warriors in tow.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The headquarters is enveloped in an air of deathly silence.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"As though expecting this development, Hotori opens her mouth again.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As I just told Maki, you are to strictly refrain from any and all unauthorized actions.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course, I share every bit of your outrage at Her\nMajesty's marriage.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let us unleash all of our fury on the day of our uprising!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"The remaining members respond in unison.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I suppose that settles that.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I'm glad we managed to get the situation under control.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Hotori proceeds to individually talk down each of the warriors who seek her opinion.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I would have thrown in the towel a long time ago, but Hotori is unwaveringly patient.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"She is willing to go to such great lengths only because of the bitter experiences she's been through.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"During the war, she served as the captain of the Myougi Squad, and she watched nearly all of her subordinates die before her very eyes.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"It was that experience which instilled within her this fierce resolve to not let any more of her comrades die in vain.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"The Myougi Squad was a unit of young disciples from the Myougikan, a unit that was never expected to see real combat.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Far from an actual combat unit, it might've been more appropriate to call them a band of Boy Scouts playing at blade arts in order to build camaraderie.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Naturally, their equipment and skills were both greatly lacking.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Even so, when faced with the full might of the Republican Army, they stood, and they fought...",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"...and they perished.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Their lives were all scattered to the wind, leaving behind only their captain, Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Eagerly obeying their captain's orders, these bright-faced youths rushed headlong into battle, into their deaths...",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"What must Hotori have felt upon witnessing such a tragedy?",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"And how deeply must she blame herself for being the only survivor?",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"My cell phone suddenly rings out.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"It's from Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The clock shows that it's nearly two in the morning.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We are in terrible trouble!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama has gone missing!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari?!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"My mind goes completely blank.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"My heart is beating so furiously it feels like it's going to burst.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I take a moment to calm myself down.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, where are you right now?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am in Akari-sama's room with the manager.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait for me. I'll be there in five minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's gone missing.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have to go.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I fly out of the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Taking the shortest possible route, I return home by leaping across the rooftops.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"In Akari's room, I find Kotone and the manager with their arms crossed.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ahh, Soujin-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tell me everything that happened.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After the commotion during dinner, Akari-sama escorted me to the Imperial Temple for my own safety.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We parted ways after we arrived at the Temple, but then...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“She never made it back.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When did you part ways at the Temple?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sometime past eleven of the clock.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"It's been over three hours since then.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I try to call Akari, but the call doesn't connect at all.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She must be in a dead zone, or else her phone is turned off.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could it be just an accident, or was she caught up in some crime?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I checked with the Imperial Police just in case, but they\nhaven't received any reports of such an accident.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Which means she's the victim of a crime.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did she say anything that might give us a clue?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, nothing of the sort.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, try to remember.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I understand how you feel, sir, but she really was acting the same as usual.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Even I can't believe how agitated I am.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I take a deep breath and try to cool my head, but my heartbeat refuses to slow down.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, let's split up and retrace the routes Akari\nwould've taken.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Manager, could you keep checking to see if there is any information online?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Yes, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I hastily head downstairs together with Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The moment we step outside, Kotone bows to me.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If only I had kept myself together, all this never would have─”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, it's entirely my responsibility for failing to stay by her side.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, it is not! It is all because I fell unconscious, and Akari-sama was worried about me, and I...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, I... I cannot...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Tears spill over from her large eyes.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It'll be fine. We'll definitely find her.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I gently pat Kotone on the shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come on, let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Kotone and I walk to the Imperial Temple together.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"We find nothing.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I call the manager for an update on his investigation.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"No luck on his end either.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"One more time. I'll check just one more time.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I search a different route but still come up with nothing.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"It seems like she really has been kidnapped.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"But if so, then who could the culprit be?",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Okonogi? A Republic soldier blinded by lust? The student council president, after discovering Akari's true identity?",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Every scenario seems equally plausible.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Could she truly have been abducted?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know, but you're probably not far off.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"It would be much simpler if there was a ransom demand, but at present, it's impossible to say anything for certain.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"It's even possible that she's no longer alive.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, whyever did this have to happen?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"She buries her face in her hands, slicked with sweat from running around all evening.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"It seems like she can't help but feel responsible for everything that happened.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know how it'd work, but might you be able to use your magicks to locate her?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Kotone looks up with a start.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I remember now!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I returned Akari-sama's Artifact after I finished appraising it!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With such a powerful Artifact, it is possible that I can trace its spellforce.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall be borrowing Akari-sama's room!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What should I do?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please be prepared to depart at a moment's notice!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
